      "content": "English: Perizzites | French: Perizzite | Latin: Pherezaeus | Origin: &#64324;&#1456;&#1512;&#1460;&#1494;&#1468;&#1460;&#1497; | Vietnamese: Pơ-rít-di (người) -- Tl 1,4 ; Gs 17,15",
